- |changePercent| exactly 5 (previous=-1000, change=+50 -> pct=5 exactly):
  direction="stable" -- confirms the fix preserved the STRICT >5/<-5
  operators from master (diffed master's classifier: identical operators,
  same threshold values, comment-documented as "unchanged").
- previous negative and tiny (previous=-0.01, current=1000): change_amount=
